 DirSelect_BigFont;myGuiParms;info;parms
⍝ Allows the user to select a directory.
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 #.⎕SHADOW'MyFonts'
 #.MyFonts←∆CreateFonts 48
 info←'Where would you like to install the software?'
 parms←##.GUI.DirSelect.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'Directory'
 parms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel fontAPL)←#.MyFonts.(standard input label apl)
 parms.(hGap vGap)←parms.fontStandard.Size
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.GUI.DirSelect.Run'C:\Windows\System32'
